WEBVTT

00:07:29.036 --> 00:07:31.956
I see a whole generation that is rising,

00:07:31.996 --> 00:07:35.316
leading by example and taking action.

00:07:35.356 --> 00:07:38.916
Youth activism is more
than an inspiration.

00:07:39.476 --> 00:07:42.116
We are serious about change.

00:07:42.676 --> 00:07:43.796
Thank you.